### Benchmark harness ###
# reports/ (above) stays ignored: Grafana PDFs are large and regenerable.
# bench-results/ is TRACKED — meta/dump/verdict/summary/profile JSON are the thesis
# data and must be versioned alongside the code that produced them. Only the rendered
# PDF and python bytecode are excluded.
bench-results/**/report.pdf
__pycache__/
*.pyc
